      "word": "HOY",
      "definitions": [
        {
          "text": "A small coaster vessel, usually sloop-rigged, used in conveying passengers and goods from place to place, or as a tender to larger vessels in port. The hoy went to London every week. Cowper.",
          "partOfSpeech": "noun"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ho! Halloe! Stop!",
